    "The Claude and Codex helpers send session status to the server. macOS asks for each helper separately." : {},
    "The Dashboard tracks these." : {},
    "The Pomodoro is off in Ember." : {},
    "The activity card scrolls the current tool call next to the icon. These apply to this Mac's sessions." : {},
    "The activity card scrolls the last few tool calls, newest first, instead of only the current one. It needs the activity card." : {
      "comment" : "From EmberKit (not extracted automatically; kept in step by StringCatalogTests).",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
