      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The clock adds these offsets to its sensor's readings; the temperature one makes up for the clock warming itself. Compare Measured now with a thermometer you trust and change the offset by the difference." : {},
    "The clock capitalizes the text of pushed apps and notifications before drawing them; an app can ask for its own case instead. Default: on." : {
      "comment" : "From EmberKit (not extracted automatically; kept in step by StringCatalogTests).",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The clock chimes once when a session starts waiting for you or hits an error and takes over the screen. Quiet hours mute it." : {
      "comment" : "From EmberKit (not extracted automatically; kept in step by StringCatalogTests).",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
